{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t搭載神舟二十四號載人飛船的長征二號F遙二十四運載火箭，早上8時18分在酒泉衛星發射中心發射升空。<br/>\n<br/>\n飛船與火箭成功分離，進入預定軌道，航天員乘組狀態良好，發射中心宣布，發射取得圓滿成功。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T01:03:54.060702+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T00:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:57:24.614236+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T00:57:24.614236+00:00","content_hash":"473f71422405915a1a1ce3c564792fb2059c9578cf013e61d69d3a2ed2a2fa41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}